WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:02.535
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.535 --> 00:00:03.603
We hope you're doing well.

00:00:03.603 --> 00:00:04.970
And now we're gonna get
to the news.

00:00:04.970 --> 00:00:08.775
President Biden is facing
criticism after he fist-bumped

00:00:08.775 --> 00:00:11.344
Saudi Crown Prince
Mohammed bin Salman

00:00:11.344 --> 00:00:14.013
last week during their
first in-person meeting.

00:00:14.013 --> 00:00:16.082
Of course, at this point,
that's like saying

00:00:16.082 --> 00:00:18.084
"Mosquitos are
facing criticism."

00:00:18.084 --> 00:00:19.085
When weren't they?

00:00:19.085 --> 00:00:20.453
[ Light laughter ]

00:00:20.453 --> 00:00:23.389
First Lady Dr. Jill Biden
apologized last week,

00:00:23.389 --> 00:00:25.891
after she said that
the Latino community is, quote,

00:00:25.891 --> 00:00:29.729
"as unique as the breakfast
tacos here in San Antonio."

00:00:29.729 --> 00:00:30.963
[ Laughter ]

00:00:30.963 --> 00:00:33.867
Said Biden in her apology,
"I'm as sorry

00:00:33.867 --> 00:00:36.269
as the breakfast tacos
at Taco Bell."

00:00:36.269 --> 00:00:38.438
[ Laughter ]

00:00:38.438 --> 00:00:40.973
Former President Trump and
former Vice President

00:00:40.973 --> 00:00:43.609
Mike Pence are set to hold
competing rallies on Friday

00:00:43.609 --> 00:00:45.345
in Arizona.
It will be the first time

00:00:45.345 --> 00:00:47.847
they've faced off
since January 6th.

00:00:47.847 --> 00:00:50.183
[ Audience ohs ]

00:00:50.183 --> 00:00:52.719
Jennifer Lopez and Ben Affleck
over the weekend

00:00:52.719 --> 00:00:54.120
reportedly got married.

00:00:54.120 --> 00:00:55.855
Guests were offered beef,
chicken,

00:00:55.855 --> 00:00:57.991
or bacon, egg, and cheese.

00:00:57.991 --> 00:01:01.027
[ Light laughter ]

00:01:02.962 --> 00:01:05.231
I felt really good
about that joke earlier.

00:01:05.231 --> 00:01:06.299
[ Laughter ]

00:01:06.299 --> 00:01:07.333
You know what,
it's for a certain --

00:01:07.333 --> 00:01:09.435
it's for a certain region
of America.

00:01:09.435 --> 00:01:10.970
[ Light laughter ]

00:01:10.970 --> 00:01:12.839
Hope you enjoy it, New England!

00:01:12.839 --> 00:01:14.907
[ Laughter ]

00:01:14.907 --> 00:01:16.876
That's right, Ben Affleck
and Jennifer Lopez

00:01:16.876 --> 00:01:19.311
reportedly got married over
the weekend, because right now,

00:01:19.311 --> 00:01:22.147
that's the only way a Red Sox
fan can get a win in the Bronx.

00:01:22.147 --> 00:01:23.149
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:23.149 --> 00:01:24.984
[ Audience oohs ]

00:01:24.984 --> 00:01:28.454
Wow. I took it right --
I took it right back.

00:01:28.454 --> 00:01:30.689
Told a joke for New England
that bombed in New York,

00:01:30.689 --> 00:01:33.693
And then [bleep] 'em
with the next joke.

00:01:33.693 --> 00:01:37.463
[ Laughter ]

00:01:37.463 --> 00:01:40.133
Starbucks CEO Howard Schultz
announced recently

00:01:40.133 --> 00:01:43.635
that the coffee chain will close
16 stores due to rising crime.

00:01:43.635 --> 00:01:45.304
The most egregious crime?

00:01:45.304 --> 00:01:47.173
Waiting until you're
at the front of the line

00:01:47.173 --> 00:01:48.608
before looking at the menu.

00:01:48.608 --> 00:01:49.843
[ Laughter ]

00:01:53.146 --> 00:01:57.150
"Oh, so the sizes
are in Italian."

00:01:57.150 --> 00:02:00.553
[ Laughter ]

00:02:00.553 --> 00:02:03.823
The fast food restaurant Subway
recently changed the names

00:02:03.823 --> 00:02:06.126
of several of its sandwiches,
including switching

00:02:06.126 --> 00:02:08.394
the meatball marinara
to "The Boss,"

00:02:08.394 --> 00:02:11.064
as opposed to what's usually
called "the boss" at Subway --

00:02:11.064 --> 00:02:12.799
a 16-year-old kid.

00:02:12.799 --> 00:02:15.200
[ Laughter ]

00:02:15.200 --> 00:02:17.403
Lego recently announced
that they will release

00:02:17.403 --> 00:02:19.972
a new set based on the sitcom
"The Office."

00:02:19.972 --> 00:02:23.409
Though, if your kid wants that,
bad news, they're a Dwight.

00:02:23.409 --> 00:02:27.146
[ Laughter ]

00:02:27.146 --> 00:02:29.716
And finally, producers have
announced that a reboot

00:02:29.716 --> 00:02:31.984
of the procedural
"Criminal Minds" will air

00:02:31.984 --> 00:02:34.453
on the streaming service
Paramount+.

00:02:34.453 --> 00:02:36.522
So if you're a big fan of
detective work,

00:02:36.522 --> 00:02:39.325
try and figure out how to watch
Paramount+.

00:02:39.325 --> 00:02:40.927
[ Laughter ]

00:02:40.927 --> 00:02:42.795
And that was a monologue,
everybody!

00:02:42.795 --> 00:02:43.863
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:43.863 --> 00:02:46.599
Peacock made me tell
that last joke.

